    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8643583613870080
    m_Localized: If the file name is grayed out, it means that information about
      the bundle is available on the server, but the application does not have the
      bundle. Such bundle cannot be uploaded to the server, but can be removed from
      the server if it is no longer needed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8643900405456896
    m_Localized: Before uploading scenes to the server, it is necessary to build
      bundle files. To do this, use menu Assets->Build Asset Bundle->Scene. After
      building the bundle files will be displayed in the list.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8644745125699584
    m_Localized: Before uploading avatar to the server, it is necessary to build
      bundle files. To do this, use menu Assets->Build Asset Bundle->Avatar. After
      building the bundle files will be displayed in the list.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
